{"connection_id": "BC-b7f94b1a96b4644ebc2d", "ref": "WLC:Prov.3.6", "target": "sec1", "tradition": "tevrat", "kind": "motif", "basis": "God makes paths straight", "note": "The promise that God will make the paths straight connects acknowledgment of God with a route made traversable and direct."}
